  title: Independence
  text: At midnight on 14 to 15 August 1947 India became independent. Jawaharlal Nehru, the first Prime Minister, spoke of India's tryst with destiny. Lord Mountbatten stayed on as Governor-General, followed by C. Rajagopalachari.
